JUring implements the Linux io_uring userspace ABI directly through the Java
Foreign Function & Memory API. It does not include or link liburing, JNI glue, or
Seastar source code. The Seastar checkout under SeaStarRef/ is used only as a
local, gitignored benchmark reference and is not part of the distributed
artifact.

The benchmark corpus under bench/ is original work unless a script header says
otherwise.
